  },
  {
    "FileName": "",
    "Name": "CAC.WO.USAGE.AMMO.DETAILS",
    "Localization": {
      "CULTURE_EN_US": "Drag ammo bin to change order\nDouble-click mode to set default ammunition type\nNOTE! While selecting default ammo bin, you are selecting default ammunition type that will be chosen for this weapon at start, not the exact ammo bin.\nNOTE! Selecting ammo bin order you are selecting their depletion order, not ammunition type switch order. In automatic mode, ammunition is first depleted from bins in locations with lower armor",
      "CULTURE_ZH_CN": "拖拽弹药箱以改变顺序\n双击模式以设置默认弹药类型\n注意！选择默认弹药箱时，你选择的是该武器开战时会选用的默认弹药类型，而非确切的弹药箱。\n注意！选择弹药箱顺序时，你选择的是其耗尽顺序，而不是弹药类型切换顺序。在自动模式下，弹药会优先从装甲较少的部位所携带的弹药箱中消耗"
    }
  },
